give @s minecraft:written_book[written_book_content={title:"Blackstone Generator",author:"DJayFresh",resolved:true,pages:["Welcome!\n\nThis data pack converts basalt made by a basalt generator (soul soil below, blue ice above) into blackstone.\n\nEnable it from /function blackstone:config.\n\nNext page ->","Stand in front of the line of basalt, up to 5 blocks away in any horizontal direction, and it converts every tick.\n\nTo keep it running while you are away, stand where you would normally stand and click [Mark here] in the config. [Unmark] removes markers within 8 blocks.","Hope you enjoy this data pack. If you have issues, open a ticket on the pack's GitHub page:\n\ngithub.com/djayfresh/blackstone-generator\n\n- DJayFresh"]}]
